@startuml
title GitForge V1.0.0 - Ownership and Authorization
actor Visitor
actor "Authenticated User" as User
rectangle Repository {
    rectangle "Owner Identity" as Owner
    rectangle "Visibility" as Visibility
}
rectangle "Authorization Evaluation" as Authz
rectangle "Allow / Deny" as Decision
Visitor --> Authz : anonymous identity
User --> Authz : authenticated identity
Owner --> Authz
Visibility --> Authz
Authz --> Decision
note right of Authz
Read:
Public -> Allow
Private -> Owner only
Write:
Owner only
end note
@enduml
